Package: biomed
Title: Clinical and Biomedical Research Utilities
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R:
    person("Guangling", "Jie", , "104247086+jiegla@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reusable, auditable tools for clinical and biomedical research,
    including cohort preparation, endpoint analysis, biomarker exploration,
    omics workflows, and publication-ready reporting. The package is intended
    for research use and does not provide medical advice or clinical decision
    support.
